            <ArticleTitle>Exposure Time to Sunlight For Puvasol.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>373-374</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Exposure time of sunlight for PUVASOL is often arbitrarily determined. This,can-lead to either inadequate or over-exposure,. We, have evolved a computer programme, from which the exposure time can be determined. The programme, takes into consideration the, variations of UV light at different times of the day. We hove to extend this pilot study to various places in India.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
